SUBTOPIC-creator^#^
                    -=[ Help ]=-

       command: mv
        Usuage: mv <file1>
                mv <file1> <file2>

   Description: This command allows you to move file(s).  Files can use
          the token '*' as a wildcard.  If the destination
          directory/file is not given, the creator's default
          directory is used.  mv will not overwrite a file with
          the same name.  If it cannot overwrite, it will not move
          the file.

