        Usuage: Mv <file1>
                Mv <file1> <file2>

   Description: This command allows you to move file(s).  Files can use
          the token '*' as a wildcard.  If the destination
          directory/file is not given, the creator's default
          directory is used.  Mv will overwrite a file with the
          same name.

